    "name": "YVY",
    "steam_appid": 2952190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/77c2bf52dce663f58c5183b414ba224b.avif?t=1753986447\" data-has-big width=800 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YVY is a fast-paced roguelite based on a single dice customization and autobattler mechanics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own dice</strong>, with each face representing a unique skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe combat\u00a0</strong>and time your powerful abilities to turn the tide of battle in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll for resistance and protect your lands from invaders in a world inspired by the historical events of 16th-century Brazil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/7ee88e632dba5ecf81c9daf0263a95be.avif?t=1753986447\" width=610 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active auto-battler</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in real-time automatic battles where customizable dice rolls shape the flow of combat. Use active skills with our Battle Drums system to influence outcomes, striking a balance between strategy, chance, and player control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/918cab0f7728be30d787fa7038589866.poster.avif?t=1753986447\" width=610 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/918cab0f7728be30d787fa7038589866.webm?t=1753986447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/918cab0f7728be30d787fa7038589866.mp4?t=1753986447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge the perfect dice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize each face of your dice with unique abilities and see them in action as they are rolled! Strategic dice-building is essential to overcome all challenges that await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/3fdfe1a7a375d83b52b4e912d33cf6b1.avif?t=1753986447\" width=598 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than one run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time a run is completed, the story progresses, unlocking new chapters set in unique biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story progression, combined with unique enemies and evolving gameplay mechanics, will keep you engaged for hours. With hundreds of possible builds to suit your playstyle, every run offers something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/748570545b487a5d4a77ce521301aff9.poster.avif?t=1753986447\" width=610 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/748570545b487a5d4a77ce521301aff9.webm?t=1753986447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/748570545b487a5d4a77ce521301aff9.mp4?t=1753986447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/049fc6223dff4b0dce164a044c124c86.avif?t=1753986447\" width=610 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Brazilian Indigenous themes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of <i>YVY</i> is inspired by indigenous cultures and folklore from Brazil. From music to characters, scenarios, culture, and dialogue, the game provides an opportunity to discover something new and meaningful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/77c2bf52dce663f58c5183b414ba224b.avif?t=1753986447\" data-has-big width=800 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YVY is a fast-paced roguelite based on a single dice customization and autobattler mechanics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own dice</strong>, with each face representing a unique skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe combat\u00a0</strong>and time your powerful abilities to turn the tide of battle in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll for resistance and protect your lands from invaders in a world inspired by the historical events of 16th-century Brazil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/7ee88e632dba5ecf81c9daf0263a95be.avif?t=1753986447\" width=610 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active auto-battler</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in real-time automatic battles where customizable dice rolls shape the flow of combat. Use active skills with our Battle Drums system to influence outcomes, striking a balance between strategy, chance, and player control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/918cab0f7728be30d787fa7038589866.poster.avif?t=1753986447\" width=610 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/918cab0f7728be30d787fa7038589866.webm?t=1753986447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/918cab0f7728be30d787fa7038589866.mp4?t=1753986447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge the perfect dice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize each face of your dice with unique abilities and see them in action as they are rolled! Strategic dice-building is essential to overcome all challenges that await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/3fdfe1a7a375d83b52b4e912d33cf6b1.avif?t=1753986447\" width=598 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than one run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time a run is completed, the story progresses, unlocking new chapters set in unique biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story progression, combined with unique enemies and evolving gameplay mechanics, will keep you engaged for hours. With hundreds of possible builds to suit your playstyle, every run offers something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/748570545b487a5d4a77ce521301aff9.poster.avif?t=1753986447\" width=610 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/748570545b487a5d4a77ce521301aff9.webm?t=1753986447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/748570545b487a5d4a77ce521301aff9.mp4?t=1753986447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952190/extras/049fc6223dff4b0dce164a044c124c86.avif?t=1753986447\" width=610 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Brazilian Indigenous themes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of <i>YVY</i> is inspired by indigenous cultures and folklore from Brazil. From music to characters, scenarios, culture, and dialogue, the game provides an opportunity to discover something new and meaningful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "YVY is a fast-paced rogue-lite dice battler set in a world inspired by 16th-century Brazil. Channel the power of ancient divinities, craft your perfect dice by strategically choosing each face, and defend your homeland against the threat of colonial invasion. Roll for resistance!",
